  "edge_schema": "mailvora_edge_pat",
  "prompt": "For each quarter of 2025, how did the users who signed up in it move through the signup funnel, in order? A user is activated at the first first_campaign_sent event, and counts as paid only when the user's first payment (paid_at, refunded or not) came at or after that activation. A user whose first payment came before the activation does not count as paid, even if a later payment came after it, and neither does a user with no activation. The quarter is the quarter of signup_ts, in UTC. Return five columns, in this order: signup_quarter (the first day of the quarter), signed_up, activated, paid (each a number of users) and paid_step_rate, paid over activated, as a fraction between 0 and 1; it is missing for a quarter with no activated user. Return one row for each quarter. Any row order is fine.",
